        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 43.26,
          "end": 45.72,
          "en": "and kind of manually enable that button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 45.72,
          "end": 48.12,
          "en": "which you can do with the browser developer tools,",
